sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant M as Merkzettel
  participant B as Browser
  participant L as login.microsoftonline.com
  participant K as Keychain
  U->>M: Sign in
  M->>M: listen on 127.0.0.1:53682, create PKCE verifier + state
  M->>B: open /authorize?code_challenge=…&state=…
  B->>L: sign in, consent
  L-->>B: redirect to localhost:53682/callback?code=…&state=…
  B->>M: callback (state checked)
  M->>L: POST /token (code + verifier)
  L-->>M: access token + refresh token
  M->>K: store refresh token
  Note over M,K: Next start: read refresh token, refresh silently.<br/>Offline: show cache, retry later.
